{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-10-14 11:00:00', 'title': 'NEW MISSISSIPPI INITIATIVE WILL COMBAT LEADING CAUSE OF INVOLUNTARY LAND LOSS AMONG BLACK FAMILIES', 'text': "JACKSON, MISS., OCT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE CENTER FOR HEIRS' PROPERTY PRESERVATION™ AND\xa0THE MISSISSIPPI CENTER FOR JUSTICE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE\xa0MOBILE BASIN HEIRS' PROPERTY SUPPORT INITIATIVE, A\xa0TWO-YEAR\xa0PROGRAM\xa0DESIGNED\xa0TO HELP HISTORICALLY UNDERSERVED FAMILIES\xa0IN MISSISSIPPI\xa0PROTECT AND KEEP THEIR\xa0FORESTLAND;\xa0BUILD GENERATIONAL WEALTH;\xa0AND\xa0PROMOTE\xa0PRODUCTIVE, SUSTAINABLY\xa0MANAGED FORESTS."}